[h1]琉焰卿的永恒轮回 — CK3 Roguelite / New Game+[/h1]
[h3][i]……我将永不停歇地，一次次回到那个你还在的冬日[/i][/h3]
[h3][i]...I shall never cease to return, again and again, to that winter day where you still dwell.[/i][/h3]

[b]一位统治者，一条命，一次结算。死亡称量真实分数；余烬位阶跨存档保存；下一世花费其副本换取强化。[/b]
[b]One ruler, one life, one settlement. Death yields an exact score; the Ember Tier persists across saves; the next life spends its copy on upgrades.[/b]

Version 1.0.0 · CK3 1.19.0.6 · Workshop 3784706360

[b]⚠ 必须开启教程 / TUTORIAL REQUIRED：设置 → 教程选择「完整」或「警告」，切勿禁用。Existing records remain readable when disabled, but new Ember Tiers, contract PBs, and collection entries cannot be written.[/b]

[h1]玩法 / Gameplay[/h1]

开局「终末之契」：接受契约获得特质【琉焰之视】，拒绝则本局纯净无 mod。
Accept the pact (gain the Glassfire Gaze trait) or decline for a vanilla run.
【琉焰之视】拥有 0–100 经验进度：每完成一对祝福与诅咒获得 1 经验，每 10 经验提升一级并增加压力获取；悬浮特质可即时预览当前分数。
Glassfire Gaze has 0–100 progression: each completed blessing/curse pair grants 1 XP; every 10 XP raises its stress cost, and its tooltip previews your current score.
[img]https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/15858933431013250817/35F8ED403593CFC12C6D3F9EA599BA6B98F47472/?imw=5000&imh=5000&ima=fit&impolicy=Letterbox&imcolor=%23000000&letterbox=false[/img]

游戏规则提供绝对/本世成长赛道与 0/25/50/100% 继承；推荐默认是本世成长 + 100%，继承预算不设上限。四页「轮回当铺」可购买属性、资源、借命层数、重抽、封印、冠冕服务或免费宗教改革；高位阶可一次典当 10000/50000/100000 分换取三种批量强化。
Choose Absolute or Lifetime Growth scoring and uncapped 0/25/50/100% inheritance. The recommended default is Lifetime Growth + 100%. Spend it on attributes, resources, Health stacks, faith reformation, or 10,000/50,000/100,000-point bulk upgrades.
[img]https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/12568680649862568476/860585B2C756BBAA51AADE7EB1DC4B2A20CC19E5/?imw=5000&imh=5000&ima=fit&impolicy=Letterbox&imcolor=%23000000&letterbox=false[/img]

「垂青会」：祝福三选一，随后从两项符合最低稀有度的诅咒中强制选择一项。接受一对获得 1 点特质经验；拒绝整场则最终分数 -1%。
Favor sessions offer one of three blessings, followed by one of two rarity-constrained mandatory curses. A completed pair grants 1 trait XP; declining the session costs 1% final score.

六类本世契约把战争、牵制、传教、家族、建设与低压力长寿变成增量目标。3/6/10 进度提供叙事反馈、分数与跨存档 PB；【琉焰之视】每 10 XP 交替解锁重抽和封印。
Six lifetime contracts turn war, hooks, conversion, family, construction, and low-stress longevity into incremental goals. Progress 3/6/10 grants narrative feedback, score, and persistent PBs; every 10 Gaze XP alternates rerolls and seals.

[h3]1.0.0 更新 / 1.0.0 Update[/h3]
[i]付费自定义廷臣 v2 已通过 L0 与 CK3 1.19.0.6 真实 UI 验收：七页契页提供精确年龄、六项基础能力、25 项教育、17 项将才、38 项身体、36 项性格、108 项其他特质，以及所有已载入文化与信仰；也可选择归入玩家家族。配置按玩家保存，AI 无入口，且只有人物创建成功后才扣除一次金币。[/i]
[i]The paid custom-courtier v2 has passed L0 and real-UI acceptance on CK3 1.19.0.6. Seven tabs provide exact age and base skills, 25 education, 17 commander, 38 physical, 36 personality, and 108 other traits, every loaded culture and faith, and optional membership in the player's house. Pending choices are player-scoped, AI has no entry, and gold is charged once only after successful creation.[/i]

死亡结算展示真实分数；只有跨过新余烬阈值才写入量化纪录（教程通知）。有继承人时确认后进入观察者模式；无可玩继承人时由原生继承窗显示结算并退出主菜单。两者都不可继续扮演后代。
Full exact-score breakdown on death; a quantized record is written only when a new ember threshold is crossed. With an heir, confirmation enters observer mode; without a playable heir, the native succession window shows the settlement and exits to the main menu. Neither path continues as a descendant.
[img]https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/13660478083691512905/9BED1CE13F8414ABCDC72C3742CA6349E309A9A2/?imw=5000&imh=5000&ima=fit&impolicy=Letterbox&imcolor=%23000000&letterbox=false[/img]
[img]https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/12306923708257855021/CFD03A6CF4DC5104DF8E1455C5C83D243382BC20/?imw=5000&imh=5000&ima=fit&impolicy=Letterbox&imcolor=%23000000&letterbox=false[/img]

[h1]本地化 / Localization[/h1]
简中 / English / Français / Deutsch / 日本語 / 한국어 / Polski / Русский / Español
[i]九种语言均已有源文本；付费廷臣 v2 的法、德、日、韩、波、俄、西新增文案由 MiniMax-M3 辅助翻译，并经过结构、占位符、数字、CK3 原生术语、母语级人格与游戏内截断审阅。All nine languages include complete source text. The French, German, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian, and Spanish courtier additions were translated with MiniMax-M3 assistance and reviewed for structure, tokens, numbers, native CK3 terminology, persona, and in-game truncation.[/i]

[i]单机定位。/ Single-player oriented.[/i]

[h1]版本与兼容性 / Version & Compatibility[/h1]
实测基线为 CK3 1.19.0.6；上述廷臣功能已完成真实 UI 验收。推荐新开局与单机。无继承人结算使用生成的原生继承窗投影，其他同样覆盖 window_succession_event.gui 的 mod 会冲突；未逐项验证的 on_action、GUI 或同键资源组合也不作兼容保证。
The tested baseline is CK3 1.19.0.6, including real-UI acceptance for the courtier creator. New single-player games are recommended. The no-heir settlement uses a generated projection of the native succession window and conflicts with other mods replacing window_succession_event.gui; other untested on_action, GUI, or same-key combinations are not guaranteed.

[h1]一局有多长 / Run Length[/h1]
一局等于签约统治者的一生。30–50 年通常包含约 10–17 次垂青会，每次最多两个模态窗口。
One run is the contracted ruler's lifetime. A 30–50 year life usually sees about 10–17 favor sessions, at no more than two modal windows each.

[h1]FAQ[/h1]
[b]死亡后能继续继承人吗？[/b] 不能；有继承人时确认结算后进入观察者模式，无继承人时退出主菜单。
[b]Can I continue as the heir?[/b] No; settlement enters observer mode when an heir exists, or exits to the main menu when none exists.
[b]关闭教程？ / Tutorials disabled?[/b] 旧纪录可读，新纪录与契约 PB 不会落盘。Existing data is readable, but new records and contract PBs will not persist.

